"function f() { \"\\07\"; \"use strict\"; }"                       -> SyntaxError: legacy octal literals are not allowed in strict mode
"function f() { \"use strict\"; \"\\07\"; }"                       -> SyntaxError: legacy octal literals are not allowed in strict mode
"function f() { \"a\"; \"\\07\"; \"use strict\"; }"                -> SyntaxError: legacy octal literals are not allowed in strict mode
